47 Heading3 | The bug in the &gt;=
48 BodyText | Whether a cell merges now or defers is decided by CanMergeCells, which
49 BodyText | 
50 CodeSnippet | static bool CanMergeCells(Variable leftCell,
51 CodeSnippet |                           Variable rightCell)
52 CodeSnippet | {
53 CodeSnippet |     return GetPriority(leftCell.Action) &gt;=
54 CodeSnippet |            GetPriority(rightCell.Action);
55 CodeSnippet | }
56 BodyText | 
57 BodyText | Associativity is not written down anywhere. It is implied by the &gt;=
58 BodyText | 
